OL,3,GNEWSACricket club destroyed in fire
OL,4,Avows to rebuild
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe president of an almost 300-year-old
OL,7,Fcricket club says he is determined to
OL,8,Frebuild after a fire devastated its
OL,9,Fpavilion, along with decades of
OL,10,Fmemorabilia.
OL,12,FFirefighters were called to the
OL,13,Fpavilion at Peper Harow Cricket Club
OL,14,Fnear Godalming, Surrey, at about 18:45
OL,15,FGMT on 8 November.
OL,17,FClub president Steve Bradley said a lot
OL,18,Fof old artefacts from the club's
OL,19,Fhistory "that we'll never get back" had
OL,20,Fbeen destroyed.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,328,320,200,140,0,100
