OL,3,GNEWSACricket club destroyed in fire
OL,4,Avows to rebuild
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It's a great shame to now be standing
OL,7,Fhere in ruins wondering if we'd be able
OL,8,Fto play cricket here next year," he
OL,9,Ftold BBC Radio Surrey.
